    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's nothing else. that's the thing. everyone tells me \"find a new passion\" or \"start a new chapter,\" but my whole life was built on being an athlete. without that, i'm just a ghost. i look at my body and it's just... broken. it doesn't feel like a new beginning, it just feels like i'm lingering when the show is already over.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
