    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"rest\"... it's funny you use that word. because honestly, it feels less like a \"rest\" and more like I'm just waiting for the lights to go out for good. like, if the person I was is actually gone, why does the body have to keep dragging itself through the motions? it feels like I'm just holding onto a corpse.",
